        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>雀巢 Nestle 商业模式画布</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #7fc7e8;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .logo-placeholder {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 50px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #cfe9f5, #cfe9f5 4px, #eaf6fc 4px, #eaf6fc 8px);\n    border: 1px dashed #7fc7e8;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #2a7fb0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .nestle-text {\n    color: #1a73a8;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n  }\n  .title-main {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n  }\n  .strategy-block {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin: 4px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .strategy-sub {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .strategy-main {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .brand-intro {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .brand-intro b { color: #111; }\n\n  .canvas-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    grid-template-rows: auto auto;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n  }\n  .cell {\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    padding: 5px 6px;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  .cell-title {\n    color: #1a73a8;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .cell-sub {\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .partners { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3; }\n  .activities { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }\n  .resources { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; }\n  .value { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1 / 3; }\n  .customer-rel { grid-column: 4; grid-row: 1; }\n  .channels { grid-column: 4; grid-row: 2; }\n  .segments { grid-column: 5; grid-row: 1 / 3; }\n\n  .bottom-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    border-top: none;\n  }\n  .cost { grid-column: 1; padding: 5px 6px; border-right: 1px solid #999; font-size: 9.5px; }\n  .revenue { grid-column: 2; padding: 5px 6px; font-size: 9.5px; }\n\n  .cost-columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .cost-columns .col { flex: 1; }\n  .cost-columns .label {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n\n  ul { margin: 2px 0 2px 12px; padding: 0; }\n  li { margin-bottom: 1px; }\n\n  .goal-box {\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n  }\n\n  hr.thin { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 4px 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"logo-placeholder\">[Logo: Nestlé 鸟巢图标]</div>\n    <span class=\"nestle-text\">Nestle</span>\n    <span class=\"title-main\">商业模式画布</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"strategy-block\">\n    <div class=\"strategy-sub\">战略模式--</div>\n    <div class=\"strategy-main\">全球TOP食品公司</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"brand-intro\">\n    【品牌简介】雀巢是全球知名的食品饮料公司。拥有从全球知名品牌，到各地受欢迎的本土产品，业务遍布全球一百多个国家和地区。从一个生产婴儿食品的乡村作坊发展成今天领先世界的食品公司，雀巢走过了130多年的发展历程。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"canvas-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cell partners\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">重要伙伴</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-sub\">有效运作所需的供应商和合作伙伴</div>\n      <div>对内</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li>全体80多个国家拥有500多家工厂，还25万名员工</li>\n        <li>雀巢在全球拥有强大的合作和营销网络的大量科学家和技术人员在研发领域工作</li>\n        <li>并与风险投资、跨学科合作伙伴和年轻的创业家保持着紧密的合作关系</li>\n        <li>合作伙伴关系全球30家产学合作技术中心和研发中心</li>\n        <li>为创新提供技术支持、增长</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div>电商与物流（国内零售各合作绿色供应链）</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell activities\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">成功执行必需的重要业务环节</div>\n      <div>研发-管理-并购三方，享全球食品饮料红利</div>\n      <div>理念:</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li>通过创新的老字号和相关基础设施[?]</li>\n        <li>寻求新的市场部门以创造新的方式?</li>\n        <li>销售渐进的新品铺设途径的模式增长趋势</li>\n        <li>在技术支持和相关方能协作方式</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell resources\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">核心资源</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-sub\">模式运转所需要的资源</div>\n      <div>在食品制造领域内的四百多年的经验，对2新营养和品品加工，食品原材料的应用不断追求，高品质原材料的应用，高素质的员工和艰苦研发方面的巨额投资</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell value\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">价值主张</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-sub\">为客户创造的价值的内容或提出解决</div>\n      <div><b>理念:</b></div>\n      <div>无分发提供品的力量，提升有个个体的生活质量，无论当下还是未来</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:4px;\"><b>主张:</b></div>\n      <div>坚持诚信、合法经营，尊重员工和合作伙伴</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:4px;\">我们的研发网络将\"质量提升于设计\"的理念应用到所有的产品和研发</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:4px;\"><b>产品:</b></div>\n      <div>咖啡、奶品、谷物和饮料</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell customer-rel\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">客户关系</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-sub\">如何与客户建立及维系关系</div>\n      <div>会员俱乐部、积分制福利兑换、电商优惠组合等常规营销店铺标签化标签、包装设计手册、品牌化战略、全球消费者服务热线</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell channels\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">渠道通路</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-sub\">企业服务流程中的接触点</div>\n      <div>线上商城</div>\n      <div>电商渠道</div>\n      <div>产品销往全球100多个国家和地区</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell segments\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">客户细分</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-sub\">所服务的客户群体的划分</div>\n      <div>没有特别巨大的大客户群体，根据产品需求不同细分消费群体</div>\n      <div class=\"goal-box\">\n        到2030年的目标：帮助5000万儿童拥有更健康的生活\n        <br><br>\n        在与雀巢公司的商业活动直接相关的社区中，帮助3000万人改善生活。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-grid\">\n    <div class=\"cost\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">成本结构</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-sub\">商业模式运转下所引发的成本</div>\n      <div class=\"cost-columns\">\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <div>1人力成本、技术研发运维成本、一般及行政开支、商品成本、门店运维成本</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col\">\n          <div>原材料成本、广告营销活动成本、流量成本、包装成本、周边成本、其他成本</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cost-columns\">\n        <div class=\"col label\">可变成本</div>\n        <div class=\"col label\">固定成本</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"revenue\">\n      <div class=\"cell-title\">收入来源</div>\n      <div class=\"cell-sub\">企业通过向客户提供价值主张所获得的收入</div>\n      <div>各类产品销售收入(95%来自食品的销售)</div>\n      <div>投资收入</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
